{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "1aa404469469d806bd3bd6e2f9f48e44fb260924d33a92904c521442a8e84b03", "ja": "久しぶりに、いつも通り", "zh": "久违地，一如往常", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d3b1d8f6fee940b8df2202a4dee63a9cebb4e391016e178a759a9f1d4741e669", "ja": "劇場の工事で今日も忙しいプロデューサー。\nそこに紗代子達が現れる。備品を取りに来た\n……という建前で、劇場に来たかったのだと\n言う。久しぶりに話せたことで、アイドル達\nもプロデューサーも元気を取り戻す。", "zh": "因剧场施工，制作人今天也忙得不可开交。  \n这时，纱代子她们出现了。她们说是来拿剧场的  \n备品……但那只是表面上的说法，其实是想来剧场  \n看看。久违地聊了会儿后，偶像们和制作人  \n都恢复了精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9b64d6321aaf8220246073472e49baff151ca18d8e76e239de052bbb821f781f", "ja": "（劇場の改修が進んでいる。今は業者さんと、\n施工計画について打ち合わせ中だ）", "zh": "（剧场的改修正在进行中。现在正在和施工方商量施工计划。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1001_gyousya", "source_sha256": "971109d4f3270eb81ede36790f2851c3573f43e54ac39b136757e543e3d0e1b0", "ja": "うーん……なるべく急ぎますけど、床の貼り直しと\nなると、やっぱりそれなりに時間が……。", "zh": "嗯……我会尽量加快进度，不过要重新铺地板的话，果然还是需要花些时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8f23f6fe7cd0431222a62f2e16f5c234d1b28ab8e3a3b9eb906c0254b5689f00", "ja": "そうですか……では、先に控え室をお願いできますか？\nあちらを先に使えるように……", "zh": "这样啊……那能先处理一下休息室吗？\n先让那边可以使用……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d1e4820a6300acd1b58f4c036786b1240a98a5fc59708afacca94bbd83b940b6", "ja": "……ふぅ、っと。あとは……", "zh": "……呼。接下来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "a6a8a163ff9eaac6ff8064d3e7919d63663b3db114031811647489572cdc80e7", "ja": "{$P$}！　お疲れさまですっ！\nなんだか、すっごくお久しぶりな気が……！", "zh": "{$P$}！辛苦了！\n总觉得，好像好久没见了呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f9dd872db62ab16761a03d2c75d4700f7ba1798420f25eddd5b9a64e3411286b", "ja": "あれっ！？　紗代子？\nビックリした……来てたのか。", "zh": "咦！？　纱代子？\n吓了我一跳……你过来了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "782e92a9560ee3e3a3d9f9f4ad0a82fb69ffdfef43ee68401e9e13784037bfd5", "ja": "うっうー！　私もいますよ、{$P$}！\nえへへ♪　お顔が見られて、嬉しいなーって。", "zh": "呜呜—！我也在哦，{$P$}！\n嘿嘿♪能见到您，我好开心呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "aeaf22f533fccd95087e9edfd4694c6a32cba30fd309b463a4c2c601c8d072e5", "ja": "やよいまで……一体どうしたんだ？", "zh": "连弥生也……到底怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "09acdd810ecd83e03233a4ed4fc1577908520e6718fdbefc8c2f602e83e7431b", "ja": "事務室の備品を取りに来た……っていうのが建前で。\nなんだかんだ、ここに来たかったんです。ふふっ。", "zh": "我是来拿办公室的用品……不过这只是表面上的理由。\n说到底，我就是想来这里。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "481bc17ba1633d5d90be51486a265fef66d4b2447a585ea5ed9c4b9c1401a34c", "ja": "兄ちゃーんっ！\n真美に会えない間、寂しくて眠れなかった？", "zh": "哥哥——！\n在见不到真美的这段时间里，是不是因为寂寞得睡不着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1010_p", "source_sha256": "798b9880e9009431c75d65c8dc170dfe3efe2a48807a9872ee3ba3ec92a979a6", "ja": "えっ、そこまでは……いや。\n寂しくても、ちゃんと寝ないと体に悪いし。", "zh": "诶，倒也不至于……不对。\n就算寂寞，也得好好睡觉，不然对身体不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "dca7a8882397d9da665683445b5ab9016297d5831378ac85197477717785e980", "ja": "ホント～？\nももーんは眠れなかったって！", "zh": "真的～？\n桃子都说她睡不着嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "9b25b28d0f31f8739ec648454876a9a2039e84d69812844f34a0298d0825a19f", "ja": "ちょっと真美さん、意味のないウソつかないで！\nお兄ちゃん、本気にしないでね？", "zh": "真美姐，别撒这种毫无意义的谎！\n哥哥，你可别当真哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4e8ddf292e51adab431b3c5d6f0743efdf2b33181e7daeda7438ddc0e1f1ed40", "ja": "ははは……なんだろう。久しぶりに\n賑やかな気がするよ。工事の音は毎日してるのに。", "zh": "哈哈哈……怎么说呢，好久没有这种热闹的感觉了。明明每天都有施工的声音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "484efffe820b936c0336e17808f1222e19dd0b30121ac6593844c4e097295449", "ja": "真美達、工事の音にも負けないくらい\n毎日どんちゃんにぎやかだったもんね！", "zh": "我们真美每天都热热闹闹的，声音大得都不输给施工声了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fb5011a802143eed402fab2764460149836de80c8b188fedcfa62d328b2cd13d", "ja": "そうだな。それは本当にそうだ。", "zh": "是啊，确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "9e1d56bdb6287c161e9447acf2d96be7e90ccce0bd6e5890c6fa0aedb7bbb56b", "ja": "でも、今日は{$P$}に\n会えてよかったです。なんだか安心しました。", "zh": "不过，今天能见到{$P$}先生，真是太好了。不知怎么的，让我安心了许多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1ae0848cc357d9921bb4ba04e5bd66c58da9abdc036ca4fee72e241de3daf1ec", "ja": "そうか……うん。\nあまり顔を出せなくてごめんな。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯。\n没能经常露面，真是抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "6fc67c7776e23018485a4f14178969b86d5fd2c26d6676096160316c0b5f85e2", "ja": "謝ることじゃないでしょ？　仕事なんだから。\n桃子たちだって、ちゃんとしてるし。", "zh": "没什么好道歉的吧？这是工作嘛。\n桃子和大家也都很努力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "2b3bdc19779473e9ff7ce72501eba58ad592bbacb733df9dbaa9d99cb2231534", "ja": "でも桃子、{$P$}に会うまで\nちょっとだけ元気なかったよね？", "zh": "不过，在见到{$P$}之前，桃子还是稍微有点没精神吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "fa65138c3b9407f99c7de2ce95965f484dc45710640a768ff6010eb647ad1d21", "ja": "や、やよいさんまで！　桃子は別に……うう。", "zh": "连、连弥生小姐都这样！桃子才没有……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "5d10c6bfbdb02634f5c56fa00f12a95d4db1014b6478f88e91849854e422fceb", "ja": "んっふっふ～！　こんな時くらい、\n意地を張らないほうがいいぞよ、ももーん！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～！至少这种时候，就别再逞强啦，桃桃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "2c20f4f0b29013a1847df29322adbb9f5cebabeef41bf465b37d0d8f2337a9b9", "ja": "もう……お兄ちゃん、早く工事終わらせてよね！\n桃子、もうちょっとならガマンするから……。", "zh": "真是的……大哥哥，施工要快点结束哦！\n桃子稍微忍耐一下……还是做得到的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "591d035802a879f0cde83889bf64ccb8bbd3b486049ddd6b41d12def15dae4d6", "ja": "（劇場は、みんなの大切な居場所だ。手は抜かずに、\nでも、なるべく早くしないとな……頑張るぞ！）", "zh": "（剧场是大家珍视的地方。不能偷工减料，但也得尽可能快点完成才行……我会加油的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
